data.body:
@pagameba Actually, may be an issue with this. Shopify's docs are noting it uses state, locale, and possibly nonce.

It may be safer to check and remove the "q" part.

I've tried several apps and can't see this "q" variable, where did you notice it?

@pagameba Yup and protocol by looks of it. If you can add those in and send a PR, I'll re-test again.

I tested with the original PR and noticed a test failed on this package, looking into the test, its an HMAC from Shopify's docs, which lead me to see it does use things like state/locale/nonce/protocol.

Edit: Its possible this is your issue with the "q": https://laracasts.com/discuss/channels/general-discussion/laravel-request-q-parameter. Nginx try_files would need an update.
